# Replace generic srams with new tc_sram modules

this change would allows us to use xilinx parametrized macros for the FPGA port instead of separately synthesizing xilinx block memory IPs

PR Title: Remove explicit fpga RAM instantiation

PR #69 (Merged by bluewww on June 25, 2021)

Description:
The change eliminates the need for out-of-context synthesis of Xilinx SRAM IPs in FPGA ports. Instead, the `tech_cells_generic` `tc_sram` wrapper now handles Xilinx parametrized macro instantiation when bender/IPapprox targets are properly configured. This approach eliminates manual synchronization requirements between RTL and FPGA TCL scripts regarding SRAM memory sizes.

